WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.016 --> 00:00:16.742
"Oh Wukong looked at the fan.

2
00:00:17.783 --> 00:00:18.783
fan doesn't work!

3
00:00:20.724 --> 00:00:22.585
The Iron Immortal must have tricked me."

4
00:00:24.345 --> 00:00:27.306
The travelers backed away as the fire burned hotter.

5
00:00:28.907 --> 00:00:29.507
will we do?"

6
00:00:29.828 --> 00:00:30.768
asked the Tang Monk.

7
00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:32.921
"We can't go through that fire."

8
00:00:34.922 --> 00:00:35.882
threw his hands up.

9
00:00:36.182 --> 00:00:37.623
"Let's just go home.

10
00:00:38.383 --> 00:00:40.884
We'll write a letter to Buddha explaining what happened."

11
00:00:40.904 --> 00:00:43.905
"Bajie, we can't do that!"

12
00:00:44.185 --> 00:00:45.486
the Tang Monk scolded.

13
00:00:46.586 --> 00:00:47.667
Wukong spoke up.

14
00:00:47.687 --> 00:00:51.949
"I used to be friends with the Iron Immortal's husband, the Bull Demon King.

15
00:00:52.769 --> 00:00:53.750
I have an idea."

16
00:00:56.030 --> 00:00:59.232
The Iron Immortal was in her cave when she heard a knock.

17
00:01:00.668 --> 00:01:02.649
"Oh no," she said to herself.

18
00:01:02.669 --> 00:01:04.590
"That monkey is back."

19
00:01:07.932 --> 00:01:10.754
She walked quietly to the door and peeked outside.

20
00:01:13.315 --> 00:01:17.838
When she saw the Bull Demon King, she smiled and opened the door.

21
00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:21.740
glad you're back," said the Iron Immortal.

22
00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:23.861
"Sun Wukong was here."

23
00:01:26.042 --> 00:01:27.203
used to be friends with him."

24
00:01:27.483 --> 00:01:29.456
The demon smiled.

25
00:01:29.516 --> 00:01:31.497
"It would have been nice to see him again."

26
00:01:33.237 --> 00:01:34.658
His wife was confused.

27
00:01:35.518 --> 00:01:36.118
do you mean?

28
00:01:37.098 --> 00:01:39.279
You told me that you never really liked him."

29
00:01:41.039 --> 00:01:42.220
"Oh, really?"

30
00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:43.340
said the demon.

31
00:01:44.300 --> 00:01:46.581
was very rude," said the woman.

32
00:01:46.601 --> 00:01:49.662
"He demanded I let him borrow my fan."

33
00:01:49.742 --> 00:01:53.003
"You didn't give it to him, did you?"

34
00:01:53.463 --> 00:01:54.263
asked the demon.

35
00:01:54.283 --> 00:01:57.144
"Of course not," said his wife.

36
00:01:58.076 --> 00:02:01.198
"I gave him a fake fan that looks just like the real one."

37
00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:05.380
demon began pacing.

38
00:02:09.543 --> 00:02:13.045
is very smart and very powerful," he said.

39
00:02:14.186 --> 00:02:17.327
"He'll realize you tricked him, and then he'll come back here."

40
00:02:17.347 --> 00:02:18.948
"What should we do?"

41
00:02:19.349 --> 00:02:20.469
asked the Iron Immortal.

42
00:02:21.710 --> 00:02:23.511
me the fan," said the demon.

43
00:02:23.531 --> 00:02:28.936
"I'll keep it safe."

44
00:02:29.036 --> 00:02:31.937
The Iron Immortal opened a chest and took out the fan.

45
00:02:38.140 --> 00:02:39.660
She handed it to her husband.

46
00:02:41.321 --> 00:02:44.662
Suddenly light sparkled and Wukong stood in front of her.

47
00:02:47.464 --> 00:02:48.424
tricked you!"

48
00:02:49.824 --> 00:02:52.345
The monkey laughed and ran out of the cave.

49
00:02:54.806 --> 00:02:56.927
The Iron Immortal stamped her foot.

50
00:02:59.532 --> 00:03:02.214
"Ugh!" She was still angry when her husband came home.

51
00:03:02.234 --> 00:03:07.119
"Hello, dear," said the Bull Demon King with a big smile.

52
00:03:07.879 --> 00:03:09.501
But then his smile faded.

53
00:03:09.521 --> 00:03:10.582
"What's wrong?"

54
00:03:10.602 --> 00:03:13.684
"Your friend Sun Wukong was here!"

55
00:03:14.105 --> 00:03:14.725
she snapped.

56
00:03:14.745 --> 00:03:16.907
"He's not my friend!"

57
00:03:17.227 --> 00:03:17.928
said the demon.

58
00:03:17.948 --> 00:03:22.312
"Even before he defeated Red Boy, I never really liked him."

59
00:03:22.332 --> 00:03:27.036
"Well, you'll like him even less now," said the Iron Immortal.

60
00:03:27.880 --> 00:03:29.401
"He stole my fan!"

61
00:03:30.462 --> 00:03:31.803
The demon looked surprised.

62
00:03:32.924 --> 00:03:35.325
fan's wind magic is powerful.

63
00:03:36.126 --> 00:03:37.447
How did the monkey steal it?"

64
00:03:37.527 --> 00:03:41.409
"He tricked me into giving it to him," said his wife.

65
00:03:41.429 --> 00:03:44.231
"He made himself look like you."

66
00:03:45.292 --> 00:03:46.793
demon's face turned red.

67
00:03:46.813 --> 00:03:48.554
"How dare he do that!"

68
00:03:49.195 --> 00:03:50.235
He took a deep breath.

69
00:03:51.396 --> 00:03:54.218
worry. I will find that rotten monkey.

70
00:03:55.239 --> 00:03:58.600
I'll get your fan back!"

71
00:03:58.680 --> 00:04:01.182
The Bull Demon King stomped out of the cave.

72
00:04:03.644 --> 00:04:07.386
Wukong walked along the road, carrying the plantain-leaf fan.

73
00:04:08.167 --> 00:04:11.830
He was still laughing about how he'd tricked the Iron Immortal.

74
00:04:12.410 --> 00:04:14.231
Then he saw Bajie approaching.

75
00:04:14.251 --> 00:04:16.993
"Bajie!" cried Wukong.

76
00:04:17.013 --> 00:04:18.594
"What are you doing here?"

77
00:04:18.614 --> 00:04:23.318
"I was coming to help you," said the pig.

78
00:04:24.959 --> 00:04:26.180
but I don't need help."

79
00:04:27.320 --> 00:04:28.660
Wukong held up the fan.

80
00:04:29.321 --> 00:04:32.041
"I tricked the Iron Immortal and got the real fan this time."

81
00:04:32.061 --> 00:04:34.902
"Good!" said Bajie.

82
00:04:34.922 --> 00:04:36.603
"I can carry it for you."

83
00:04:36.623 --> 00:04:40.824
"Thanks," said Wukong as he handed the fan to Bajie.

84
00:04:41.824 --> 00:04:43.765
The monkey patted his friend on the shoulder.

85
00:04:43.785 --> 00:04:46.525
"Now let's get back to Master.

86
00:04:46.926 --> 00:04:49.946
We need to—" Suddenly there was a flash of light.

87
00:04:50.747 --> 00:04:55.028
A second later the Bull Demon King stood next to Wukong.

88
00:04:55.860 --> 00:04:57.402
demon laughed.

89
00:04:57.422 --> 00:04:59.924
"I tricked you, Wukong!"

90
00:05:01.045 --> 00:05:04.267
There was another flash and the demon was gone.
